-- The model reads the popped word back byte by byte (bit masks, shifts and updates); ppe is that
-- expression (#show of x86-rcx after two steps, by tools/reify-be.py), its bits computed on 64
-- variables are the variables (lib/word.cub be-sound), and conversion checks that ppe is the
-- model's expression.
